ya␀Jade␀Brick Red␀Baby Blue␀Saffron␀Eggplant␀Cream␀Scarlet␀Pistachio␀Taupe␀Cyan␀Mahogany␀Lime␀Dove Gray␀Watermelon␀Deep Sea Blue␀Honey␀Iris␀Shell Pink␀You are allowed to take up space.␀Small steps still move you forward.␀Rest is productive too.␀You don't have to earn your worth.␀Today is a fresh page.␀Your pace is the right pace.␀You are capable of more than you think.␀It's okay to not have it all figured out.␀You are doing better than you feel like you are.␀Progress, not perfection.␀You are allowed to change your mind.␀Kindness to yourself is not weakness.␀You've survived every hard day so far.␀Growth is quiet before it's visible.␀You don't need permission to be proud of yourself.␀Today, be gentle with yourself.␀You are more than your worst day.␀Someone is glad you exist.␀You can start again as many times as you need to.␀Your feelings are valid, even the messy ones.␀You are not behind - you're on your own timeline.␀Asking for help is a strength.␀You are worthy of good things.␀Today's effort counts, even if it's small.␀You don't have to be everything to everyone.␀It's okay to rest before you're exhausted.␀You are allowed to outgrow old versions of yourself.␀Your story isn't finished yet.␀You are enough, exactly as you are today.␀Breathe - you're doing okay.␀You are not a burden.␀Setbacks are not the end of the story.␀You get to decide what today means.␀You are learning, even when it doesn't feel like it.␀Your effort matters more than the outcome.␀You are allowed to be proud of small wins.␀You can be a work in progress and still be worthy of love.␀Today doesn't have to be perfect to be good.␀You are not alone in how you feel.␀You have gotten through 100% of your hardest days.␀You're allowed to say no.␀Your presence makes a difference.␀You don't have to rush your healing.␀You are stronger than you were yesterday.␀It's okay to ask for a do-over.␀You are more resilient than you realize.␀Your best today doesn't have to match your best yesterday.␀You deserve patience, especially from yourself.␀You are allowed to celebrate the little things.␀There is no rush - you'll get there.␀You are not defined by your mistakes.␀You bring something to the world only you can.␀It's okay to move slowly today.␀You're capable of figuring this out.␀Your worth isn't up for debate.␀You are allowed to feel proud without waiting for permission.␀You can hold hope and doubt at the same time.␀You are exactly where you need to be right now.␀Today, choose the kinder thought.␀You don't owe anyone constant productivity.␀You are allowed to take the scenic route.␀Your comeback doesn't need an announcement.␀You are doing the best you can with what you have today.␀You deserve the same compassion you give others.␀There's no timeline for figuring out life.␀You are not too much - you're just you.␀You can build something good from today.␀Your calm is worth protecting.␀You are allowed to be a beginner.␀The hard days don't cancel out the good ones.␀You are someone's reason to smile today.␀You get to redefine what success looks like.␀You are allowed to outgrow people, places, and habits.␀Your journey doesn't need to look like anyone else's.␀You're not starting from zero - you're starting from experience.␀Today is enough. You are enough.␀You are allowed to protect your peace.␀Trust the process, even the slow parts.␀You are more than a checklist.␀You get to choose what you carry forward from today.␀You are allowed to be proud and still want to grow.␀Rest now so you can bloom later.␀You don't have to explain your boundaries.␀You are made of more strength than you know.␀Your softness is not a flaw.␀You are allowed to take things one hour at a time.␀You've made it through hard things before - you'll make it through this too.␀You are worth the effort you put into yourself.␀You are allowed to be both a work in progress and already whole.␀Today's small effort is tomorrow's momentum.␀You get to write the next chapter.␀You are not required to have it all together.␀Your gentleness is a strength, not a weakness.␀You are allowed to ask for what you need.␀You are doing important, quiet work just by trying.␀You are allowed to be proud of surviving, not just thriving.␀You are capable of change.␀Today can be the start of something good.␀You are allowed to slow down without guilt.␀Your presence is a gift to the people around you.␀You are not behind schedule - there is no schedule.␀You are allowed to let today be simple.␀You are still growing, even in the waiting.␀Be as kind to yourself as you are to others.␀You are allowed to feel good about today.␀Every day is a chance to begin again.␀You are not alone, even when it feels that way.␀You are worthy of rest, joy, and ease.␀Your effort today matters, even if no one sees it.␀You are allowed to be gentle with your own growth.␀You have everything you need to take the next small step.␀You are allowed to just be, without needing to prove anything.␀X<	'<P<<6<<ŒX<*␀␀␀(␀␀␀'␀␀␀␀␀␀0␀␀␀␀␀␀'␀␀␀)␀␀␀*␀␀␀␀␀␀y␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀ÈLBäLBœ7B¤7B¬7B´7B¼7B␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀è7B¤EBdGBÄ7B2B˜2B␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀8B´EBdGBÄ7B2B˜2B␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀øLBMBhLB(¡B4GB4ƒBð7B™X<X<¡X<¥X<©X<­X<±X<µX<¹X<½X<ÁX<ÅX<ÉX<ÐX<×X<ßX<éX<òX<ùX<␀␀␀ÿÿÿ€€␀␀x␀␀␀␀␀Oñÿÿ€␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Ëðÿ€␀␀ÿ␀`␀␀␀îøÿ␀␀␀0ÿÿüx␀ü{÷ÿÿ␀à␀ÿÿÿÿ„‡ÿÿÿç‡ü␀üÿÿÿÿÿÿïÿÿÿÇÇààÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿcƒÀÀÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿþ€␀=ÿÿÿÿÿÿüãÿþÀ␀␀<ÿÿÿÿÿþ@ÀÿÿÀ␀ÿÿÿÿÿÁÀ␀␀ÿïð␀ÿÿÿÿÿÀ␀␀?ÿïð␀ÿÿÿÿÿÿá€␀␀?ÿÿð␀ÿÿÿÿÿÿà␀␀␀ÿÿ˜␀ÿÿÿÿÿÿà␀␀␀ÿÿà␀ÿÿÿÿÿÿ ␀␀␀ÿÿ€␀ÿÃÿÿÿÿ0␀␀␀ÿþ␀␀Ûÿÿÿü ␀␀␀ÿü␀␀ÿÿÿÿü ␀␀␀ÿø␀␀5ÿÿÿä@␀␀␀ÿø␀␀ðÿÿÿåÀ␀␀␀ÿð␀␀ùÿÿÿã␀␀␀␀ÿà␀␀ÿÿÿÿÿà␀␀␀␀ü ␀␀ÿÿ¿ÿÿà␀␀␀␀␀ü␀␀ÿ÷ßÿÿà␀␀␀␀␀¸␀␀␀?ÿÿøÿÿÀ␀␀␀␀␀88␀␀?ÿûøÿ€␀␀␀␀␀<‚␀␀?ÿûø>}␀␀␀␀␀␀€␀␀?ÿýð<|␀␀␀␀␀À␀␀?ÿýà8>␀␀␀␀␀␀à␀␀?ÿÿ€8␀␀␀␀␀␀G␀␀?ÿÿÀ␀␀␀␀␀␀?à␀ÿÿÀ␀␀␀␀␀␀ð␀ÿÿÀ␀␀␀␀␀␀ü␀?ÿ€␀8À␀␀␀␀␀␀ü␀␀ÿ€␀À␀␀␀␀␀␀þ␀␀þ␀␀ð␀␀␀␀␀␀ÿ€␀þ␀␀ñÀ␀␀␀␀␀ÿà␀ü␀␀1ò␀␀␀␀␀ÿð␀ü␀␀␀|␀␀␀␀␀ÿð␀ü␀␀␀€h␀␀␀␀␀ÿà␀þ␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀ÿà␀þ@␀␀ ␀␀␀␀␀ÿÀ␀þÀ␀␀°␀␀␀␀␀ÿÀ␀üÀ␀␀ð␀␀␀␀ÿÀ␀øÀ␀␀ø␀␀␀␀␀ÿÀ␀ù€␀␀ø␀␀␀␀␀ÿ␀␀ù€␀␀ÿü␀␀␀␀␀þ␀␀ð␀␀␀ÿþ␀␀␀␀␀þ␀␀ð␀␀␀ÿþ␀