␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀ff†@33ƒ@␀␀€@š™y@33s@ÍÌl@fff@␀␀`@š™Y@33S@/.shelf/data/messaging/c␀{"type":"shelf-presence","id":"␀","httpPort":␀,"instance":"␀,"lastSeen":␀,"via":"␀instance␀httpPort␀away␀busy␀%08x%08x␀/.shelf/data/messaging/known-peers.json␀/.shelf/data/messaging␀/read␀timestamp␀"image":"data:␀/%08u-%c.json␀offline␀/api/messaging/hello␀Content-Type␀shelf-hello␀/api/messaging/identity␀shelf-presence␀broadcast␀â€“␀/api/messaging/peers␀{"type":"shelf-hello","id":"␀/api/messaging/known-peers␀","ip":␀,"lastSeenAt":␀/api/messaging/self␀,"addresses":["␀"],"port":␀,"lastScan":{"at":␀,"found":␀,"scanning":␀,"ranges":[␀]},"identityClash":null,"sharedIdentities":[]}␀/api/messaging/scan␀/api/messaging/add␀,"scanning":true,"addresses":␀/api/messaging/conversations␀Type an address like 10.0.0.50, 10.0.0.50:8080, or raspberrypi.local.␀That port number isn't valid.␀{"ok":false,"message":"Couldn't find a computer called \"␀\" on the network. Try its IP address instead."}␀{"ok":false,"message":"That's this Shelf."}␀Nothing answered at ␀. Check the address, and that the computer is switched on and on the same network. A firewall on that computer can also block it.␀The Shelf at ␀ is switched off, or set to \"Local computer only\".␀Something answered at ␀, but it isn't The Shelf (or its messaging is switched off).␀{"ok":false,"message":"␀{"ok":true,"peer":␀,"older":false,"warning":null}␀/api/messaging/conversations/␀ðŸ–¼ï¸ Image␀Sent an image␀{"lastInAt":␀,"lastInPreview":"␀","online":␀,"lastMessage":"␀","lastAt":␀,"unread":␀/api/messaging/receive␀,"read":true}␀/api/messaging/send␀fromId␀fromName␀fromPort␀Invalid image␀Invalid message␀"image":"␀"image":"data:image/␀","direction":"in","timestamp":␀Could not save the message␀toId␀Missing recipient, or nothing to send␀That image is too large to send.␀That person appears to be offline right now.␀/.shelf/tmp/send-␀,"fromId":"␀","fromName":"␀","fromPort":␀Could not send␀Couldn't reach that person â€” they may have just gone offline.␀","direction":"out","timestamp":␀Sent, but couldn't save it here.␀mp3␀OggS␀ID3␀TPE1␀TP1␀TIT2␀TT2␀APIC␀pusTags␀vorbis␀ARTIST␀TITLE␀METADATA_BLOCK_PICTURE␀/.shelf/data/album-art/␀²<¹<²<¹</.shelf/update-app.bin␀/api/board/update/app␀/api/board/update/www␀/api/board/update/␀/api/board/update/info␀{"fw":"1.20.0","id":"shelf-v4-dual","board":"Heltec V4","slots":␀,"running":"␀","appOffset":␀,"appMax":␀,"wwwOffset":␀,"wwwSize":␀/api/board/update/restart␀Nothing was sent.␀The update was cut off. Try again.␀web app␀firmware␀The Shelf is in read-only mode. Unlock write mode first.␀This board has no web app area. Install from the installer page over USB.␀That web app image is too big for this board.␀Couldn't start: ␀This board needs one USB install of 1.9.1 or later from the installer page first.␀That firmware is too big for this board. Is it the right board's file?␀Couldn't save the update on the card.␀The card didn't take the update. Try again, or try another card.␀The update didn't save properly on the card. Try again.␀Couldn't hand over to the loader.␀Writing failed: ␀The new ␀ didn't check out: ␀<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>Update The Shelf</title>
<style>
:root{--ink:#241B2F;--surface:#322542;--text:#F0E9E3;--muted:#B7ABBA;--accent:#F2B441;--accent-ink:#2A1D0E;--divider:#4A3B5C;--bad:#E2725B;--good:#7FD49B;color-scheme:dark}
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:var(--ink);color:var(--text);font:16px/1.5 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',system-ui,sans-serif}
.wrap{max-width:620px;margin:0 auto;padding:28px 16px 60px}h1{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:30px;margin:0 0 4px}
a{color:var(--accent)}.muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}
.card{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--divider);border-radius:16px;padding:18px;margin-top:16px}
.row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;padding:4px 0}.row span:first-child{color:var(--muted)}
button{font:inherit;font-weight:700;border:0;border-radius:999px;padding:11px 20px;cursor:pointer;background:var(--accent);color:var(--accent-ink);margin:10px 8px 0 0}
button.sec{background:transparent;color:var(--text);border:1px solid var(--divider)}button:disabled{opacity:.45;cursor:default}
.bar{height:8px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--divider);overflow:hidden;margin:12px 0 6px}.bar div{height:100%;width:0;background:var(--accent);transition:width .2s}
#msg.bad{color:var(--bad)}#msg.good{color:var(--good)}
</style></head><body><div class="wrap">
<p class="muted"><a href="/board/">&larr; Settings</a> &middot; <a href="/">The Shelf</a></p>
<h1>Update The Shelf</h1>
<p class="muted">Puts new firmware on this board over Wi-Fi. Your files, settings, Wi-Fi and admin password stay as they are.</p>
<div class="card">
  <div class="row"><span>This board</span><span id="board">&hellip;</span></div>
  <div class="row"><span>Installed</span><span id="fw">&hellip;</span></div>
  <div class="row"><span>Newest</span><span id="latest">&mdash;</span></div>
  <button id="check">Check for update</button><button id="install" hidden></button>
  <p class="muted" style="margin:12px 0 0">This uses your browser's internet, so it works on the board's own Wi-Fi too when your phone or laptop has its own connection (cellular data, say). With no internet at all, use a file instead.</p>
</div>
<div class="card">
  <b>Update from a file</b>
  <p class="muted" style="margin:6px 0 0">Pick this board's <code>-main.bin</code> from the installer page (the same file the USB installer uses).</p>
  <button class="sec" id="pick">Choose file&hellip;</button><input type="file" id="file" accept=".bin,.gz" hidden>
</div>
<div class="card" id="prog" hidden><div id="msg"></div><div class="bar"><div id="fill"></div></div><div class="muted" id="sub"></div></div>
</div>
<script>
const BASE='https://hardwaremack-prog.github.io/Tidy-Pro-Plus/shelf/';
const $=id=>document.getElementById(id);let info=null,latest=null,busy=false;
const newer=(a,b)=>{a=a.split('.').map(Number);b=b.split('.').map(Number);for(let i=0;i<3;i++){if((a[i]||0)!==(b[i]||0))return (a[i]||0)>(b[i]||0)}return false};
function say(t,cls,frac,sub){$('prog').hidden=false;$('msg').textContent=t;$('msg').className=cls||'';if(frac!=null)$('fill').style.width=Math.round(frac*100)+'%';$('sub').textContent=sub||''}
function lock(on){busy=on;for(const b of document.querySelectorAll('button'))b.disabled=on}
async function loadInfo(){info=await fetch('/api/board/update/info',{cache:'no-store'}).then(r=>r.json());$('board').textContent=info.board+(info.id.endsWith('r8')?' (R8)':'');$('fw').textContent='v'+info.fw;
  if(!info.slots)say('This board was installed with an older layout, so this first update has to go over USB. Use the installer page once with this board plugged in; after that, updates work here.','bad')}
async function gunzip(buf){const b=new Uint8Array(buf);if(b[0]!==0x1f||b[1]!==0x8b)return b;return new Uint8Array(await new Response(new Blob([b]).stream().pipeThrough(new DecompressionStream('gzip'))).arrayBuffer())}
async function download(url,label,lo,hi){const r=await fetch(url,{cache:'no-store'});if(!r.ok)throw new Error("Couldn't download the "+label+' ('+r.status+')');
  const total=+r.headers.get('Content-Length')||0,rd=r.body.getReader(),parts=[];let got=0;
  for(;;){const {done,value}=await rd.read();if(done)break;parts.push(value);got+=value.length;if(total)say('Downloading the '+label+'â€¦','',lo+(hi-lo)*got/total)}
  return gunzip(await new Blob(parts).arrayBuffer())}
function send(part,data,lo,hi,label){return new Promise((ok,no)=>{const x=new XMLHttpRequest();x.open('POST','/api/board/update/'+part);
  x.upload.onprogress=e=>{if(e.lengthComputable)say('Sending the '+label+' to the boardâ€¦','',lo+(hi-lo)*e.loaded/e.total,Math.round(e.loaded/1024)+' of '+Math.round(e.total/1024)+' KB')};
  x.onload=()=>{let j={};try{j=JSON.parse(x.responseText)}catch(e){}x.status===200&&j.ok?ok():no(new Error(j.error||('The board said '+x.status)))};
  x.onerror=()=>no(new Error('The connection to the board dropped. Try again; the board is still running its old firmware.'));
  x.setRequestHeader('Content-Type','application/octet-stream');x.send(new Blob([data]))})}
async function flash(app,www,ver){
  if(app[0]!==0xE9)throw new Error("That isn't firmware for this board.");
  if(app.length>info.appMax)throw new Error('That firmware is too big for this board. Is it for a '+info.board+'?');
  // the web app first: it goes straight to flash, so it's back even if the firmware step can't run
  // (a plain ESP32 needs its microSD card for the firmware step)
  if(www)await send('www',www,.35,.6,'web app');
  await send('app',app,.6,.98,'firmware');
  say('Restarting the boardâ€¦','',.99);await fetch('/api/board/update/restart',{method:'POST'}).catch(()=>{});
  const t0=Date.now();await new Promise(r=>setTimeout(r,6000));
  while(Date.now()-t0<120000){try{const i=await fetch('/api/board/update/info',{cache:'no-store'}).then(r=>r.json());
    say('Updated to v'+i.fw+'. Opening The Shelfâ€¦','good',1);setTimeout(()=>location.href='/',2500);return}catch(e){await new Promise(r=>setTimeout(r,2000))}}
  say('The board is restarting. If this page doesnâ€™t come back, open The Shelf again in a minute.','',1)}
$('check').onclick=async()=>{if(busy)return;lock(true);try{say('Checkingâ€¦','',0);
  latest=await fetch(BASE+'ota/'+info.id+'.json',{cache:'no-store'}).then(r=>{if(!r.ok)throw new Error('No update found for this board ('+r.status+')');return r.json()});
  $('latest').textContent='v'+latest.version;const up=newer(latest.version,info.fw);
  $('install').hidden=false;$('install').textContent=up?'Install v'+latest.version:'Reinstall v'+latest.version;
  say(up?'v'+latest.version+' is ready to install.':'This board is up to date.',up?'good':'',0)}
  catch(e){say(/Failed to fetch|NetworkError|Load failed/i.test(e.message)?"Couldn't reach the internet from this browser. Turn on cellular data (or use Update from a file).":e.message,'bad')}
  finally{lock(false)}};
$('install').onclick=async()=>{if(busy||!latest)return;lock(true);try{
  const app=await download(BASE+'ota/'+latest.app,'firmware',0,.2),www=await download(BASE+'ota/'+latest.www,'web app',.2,.35);
  if(latest.appSize&&app.length!==latest.appSize)throw new Error('The firmware download was incomplete. Try again.');
  if(latest.wwwSize&&www.length!==latest.wwwSize)throw new Error('The web app download was incomplete. Try again.');
  await flash(app,www,latest.version)}catch(e){say(e.message,'bad');lock(false)}};
$('pick').onclick=()=>$('file').click();
$('file').onchange=async()=>{const f=$('file').files[0];$('file').value='';if(!f||busy)return;lock(true);try{
  say('Reading '+f.name+'â€¦','',.05);const b=await gunzip(await f.arrayBuffer());let app,www=null;
  if(b[0]===0xE9&&b.length<=info.appMax){app=b}
  else{
    // the installer's -main.bin starts at 0xE000; a full image starts at 0
    const base=[0,0xE000].find(o=>b.length>=info.wwwOffset-o+info.wwwSize&&b[info.appOffset-o]===0xE9);
    if(base===undefined)throw new Error("That file isn't this board's installer image (the -main.bin from the installer page).");
    const A=info.appOffset-base,W=info.wwwOffset-base;
    let end=W;while(end>A&&b[end-1]===0xFF)end--;end=Math.min(W,A+Math.ceil((end-A)/4096)*4096);
    app=b.slice(A,end);www=b.slice(W,W+info.wwwSize)}
  if(!confirm('Install '+f.name+' on this board?'))throw new Error('Cancelled.');
  await flash(app,www)}catch(e){say(e.message,'bad');lock(false)}};
loadInfo().catch(()=>say("Couldn't read the board's details.",'bad'));
</script></body></html>␀{"running":␀","error":"␀","copied":␀,"skipped":␀,"failed":␀/api/thumbs/import␀Use GET or POST␀The board needs to be on your home Wi-Fi to reach the computer.␀Type the address of The Shelf on your computer, like 10.0.0.80:8080.␀Startingâ€¦␀thumbimp␀Not enough memory to start.␀artUrl␀thumbUrl␀Looking at ␀/api/files?category=␀Couldn't reach ␀ didn't answer (␀ of ␀Done␀␀©<¯<¸<ê<²<␀␀␀␀%d:/.shelf␀%d:␀/\?%*:|"<>␀other␀%.0f %s␀%.1f %s␀TB␀␀Xx<ØH<ÑH<ÊH<D´<\\␀\n␀\r␀\t␀\u%04x␀%02x%02x%02x%02x-%02x%02x-%02x%02x-%02x%02x-%02x%02x%02x%02x%02x%02x␀%016llx␀application/octet-stream␀vector::reserve␀.tmp␀;base64␀r+␀public, max-age=31536000, immutable␀bytes=␀Content-Range␀bytes */␀Accept-Ranges␀bytes ␀attachment; filename="␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Ð”Bì”Bü”B␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀ÔÌBäÌB4:BØNB2B˜2B:BÈ£B°£BX•Bü9BäB␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀d:B(•B•B4—B ”B␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀\:B8•B¬«B$—BŒ”B␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀T:BH•BÄÜBD—Bx”Btext/javascript␀mjs␀text/css␀txt␀text/plain; charset=utf-8␀text/csv␀application/xml␀image/svg+xml␀image/png␀image/jpeg␀image/gif␀image/webp␀image/bmp␀image/x-icon␀image/heic␀image/avif␀audio/mpeg␀mid␀audio/midi␀kar␀rmi␀m4a␀audio/mp4␀audio/aac␀audio/wav␀audio/ogg␀image/heif␀audio/flac␀video/mp4␀m4v␀video/webm␀mov␀video/quicktime␀ogv␀video/ogg␀mkv␀video/x-matroska␀avi␀video/x-msvideo␀3gp␀video/3gpp␀application/pdf␀application/zip␀application/wasm␀font/woff␀font/woff2␀font/ttf␀font/otf␀H<ÉS<»<ÉS<~¿<¶<¶<¶<y¿<¶<g<Ì<!¶<%¶<Ò:<%¶<D¶<?¶<b¶<H¶<£¿<X¶<1'<f¶<¥<p¶<v¶<p¶<™¿<{¶<‹¶<…¶<–¶<¶<ž¿<š¶<­¶<§¶<¸¶<²¶<ñŒ<½¶<È¶<Ì¶<Ò¶<Ì¶<×¶<Ì¶<Û¶<Ì¶<ß¶<ã¶<ó¶<í¶<ý¶<÷¶<X·<·<Ž<·<·<·<·<·<'·<!·<+·<!·<5·</·<:·<>·<N·<R·<\·<`·<q·<u·<…·<‰·<Ñ¿<”·<Ö¿<¤·<À·<´·<¶¿<Å·<¼¿<Ï·<Ã¿<Ú·<è·<ã·<‰•<¼´<'·<5·<:·<q·<\·<+·<N·<…·<␀␀␀␀ñŒ<ý¶<X·<Ž<·<ß¶<ó¶<È¶<Ò¶<×¶<Û¶<␀␀␀␀¥<v¶<1'<™¿<‹¶<–¶<£¿<­¶<·<¸¶<␀␀␀␀¸<²<K<ê<©<¯<J <¹<␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀¬q␀B{␀B(ìBpìB2B íB”ìBÀìB\íBíBü9Bä